====== Arcadyan AR7516 (aka EE Brightbox 1) ======

{{ media:arcadyan:ar7516:ar7516_orange_bright_box_1.jpg?200|}}

Also known as the //Orange Bright Box// or //EE Bright Box 1// in the UK.

  * Manufacturer's [[http://www.arcadyan.com/contentPage.aspx?type=product-detail&L2id=4&prod2id=2 | product page]]

Since ~May 2016 EE have offered a [[https://broadband.ee.co.uk/ee-bright-box-router | cosmetically different unit]] under the same "Bright Box 1" label.  The newer model stands vertically, and from the front looks much more like the [[toh:arcadyan:vr9517nac22|Bright Box 2]] (black shiny section with LEDs in the middle, two matte grey sections either side). The new model is different internally, it comes with a BCM6318 SoC, and therefore not compatible, see -> https://forum.openwrt.org/t/installing-openwrt-on-bright-box-r-wireless-router-ee/76311.

